mk(4, 'requires two or more shape handles, otherwise a sentence; operands are primitives, pulls, spins, holes, or earlier combine results', kidsOf((m) => m.cat.includes('operand') || m.cat.includes('arity')), 'Operand kinds (box, cylinder, sphere, cone, prism, wedge, rounded box, turned shapes, pull, spin incl. tubes, hole results, earlier combine results) and the arity / kind-of-argument rules. The sentence shown is the one for fewer than two shapes, the rule this row is named after.', '21b');
